{"id":"7dfd7690ebbd5feb","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-rel-transitive-closure-relation.md","title":"ZFC Rel Transitive Closure Relation","display":"df-zfc-rel-transitive-closure-relation — ZFC Rel Transitive Closure Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rel-transitive-closure-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rel-transitive-closure-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-rel-transitive-closure-relation — ZFC Rel Transitive Closure Relation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-rel-composition]]","[[58-df-zfc-relation-on]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rel-transitive-closure-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rel-transitive-closure-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rel-transitive-closure-relation — ZFC Rel Transitive Closure Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b653ee0494f3a15d\" href=\"?note=b653ee0494f3a15d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-composition\">58-df-zfc-rel-composition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"41276343f41b253b\" href=\"?note=41276343f41b253b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-relation-on\">58-df-zfc-relation-on</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (relation carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> (relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"41276343f41b253b\" href=\"?note=41276343f41b253b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-relation-on\">58-df-zfc-relation-on</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (transitive closure relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(T,R,X)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq X\\times X\\land T=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times X:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists s:n+1\\to X\\;(s(0)=x\\land s(n)=y\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;(\\langle s(i),s(i+1)\\rangle\\in R))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(T,R,X)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq X\\times X\\land T=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times X:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists s:n+1\\to X\\;(s(0)=x\\land s(n)=y\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;(\\langle s(i),s(i+1)\\rangle\\in R))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}least}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(T,R,X)\\to R\\subseteq T\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in T\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in T\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Q\\subseteq X\\times X\\;\\Bigl(R\\subseteq Q\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in Q\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in Q\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in Q)\\to T\\subseteq Q\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}least}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(T,R,X)\\to R\\subseteq T\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in T\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in T\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Q\\subseteq X\\times X\\;\\Bigl(R\\subseteq Q\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in Q\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in Q\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in Q)\\to T\\subseteq Q\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This bounded finite-path comprehension is a set in ZFC; the second assertion expands transitivity and minimality without relying on an undeclared black-box predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-composition","status":"resolved","id":"b653ee0494f3a15d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-rel-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-relation-on","status":"resolved","id":"41276343f41b253b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-relation-on]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-relation-on","status":"resolved","id":"41276343f41b253b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\subseteq X\\times X$ (relation, see [[58-df-zfc-relation-on]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(T,R,X)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq X\\times X\\land T=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times X:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists s:n+1\\to X\\;(s(0)=x\\land s(n)=y\\land\\forall i<n\\;(\\langle s(i),s(i+1)\\rangle\\in R))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}least}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(T,R,X)\\to R\\subseteq T\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in T\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in T\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in T)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall Q\\subseteq X\\times X\\;\\Bigl(R\\subseteq Q\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in Q\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in Q\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in Q)\\to T\\subseteq Q\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1684,"backlinks":[{"id":"94f95e891c920655","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3325","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-rel-transitive-closure-relation.md|58-df-zfc-rel-transitive-closure-relation]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","b653ee0494f3a15d","41276343f41b253b"]}